Sample config files included in the source distribution, tailored to
different interfaces:

sys/amiga/NetHack.cnf
sys/mac/NHDeflts
sys/msdos/NHAccess.nh
sys/share/NetHack.cnf
sys/wince/defaults.nh
sys/winnt/defaults.nh
win/X11/nethack.rc

Pick whichever is easier as a base for you to work from.

